  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Seasonal water column properties and composition were obtained with conductivity-temperature-depth (CTD) instruments and water samples to characterize physical and chemical changes in the lakes during the pre-melt to melt season periods (late May-early August).  Water sampling was carried out to assess the alkalinity, conductivity, pH, ionic concentration, and dissolved organic carbon in lake water samples from two coastal lakes."
